WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:17.980 --> 00:00:23.600
Banners glow bright on the rafters tonight
Not a Lakers fan to be seen

00:00:24.630 --> 00:00:31.870
Coach Scott calls isolation,
And Swaggy P's setting the screen

00:00:32.040 --> 00:00:37.400
The fans are howling, there 's a media storm outside...

00:00:38.720 --> 00:00:44.540
Couldn't get the win. Heaven knows I tried...

00:00:46.240 --> 00:00:49.740
Don't let them in, don't let them see

00:00:49.800 --> 00:00:58.940
Be the Mamba you always have to be
Shaquille O'Neal, don't let him knoooooow...

00:00:58.949 --> 00:01:02.869
Well, now he knoooooows!

00:01:02.869 --> 00:01:04.651
Let it tank, let it tank

00:01:04.660 --> 00:01:06.120
Let it tank, let it tank 

00:01:06.120 --> 00:01:10.180
Going 8 for 24

00:01:10.340 --> 00:01:13.500
Let it tank, Let it tank

00:01:13.500 --> 00:01:17.500
Fade away and shoot some more

00:01:17.660 --> 00:01:20.080
I don't care

00:01:20.200 --> 00:01:24.100
If I'm overpaid

00:01:24.100 --> 00:01:27.720
Let the Spurs rage on

00:01:27.720 --> 00:01:31.140
Getting old never bothered them anyway!

00:01:35.380 --> 00:01:38.020
It's funny how much distance

00:01:38.020 --> 00:01:41.620
We have from winning it all

00:01:41.820 --> 00:01:48.800
And defenders that couldn't control me
Now just steal the ball!

00:01:49.700 --> 00:01:52.720
If I retire, what would I do?

00:01:52.729 --> 00:01:56.509
Maybe I'll star in Frozen 2

00:01:56.509 --> 00:02:04.029
Do what I want, no rules for meee! I'm Kooobe! 

00:02:04.260 --> 00:02:07.500
Let it tank, Let it tank

00:02:07.640 --> 00:02:11.160
Get a pick hopefully top 5

00:02:11.160 --> 00:02:14.100
Let it tank, let it tank

00:02:14.240 --> 00:02:18.740
Without Phil, why even try?

00:02:18.980 --> 00:02:21.700
Here I stand

00:02:21.700 --> 00:02:25.080
And here I'll play

00:02:25.520 --> 00:02:29.500
If my legs hold up!

00:02:37.200 --> 00:02:42.940
My power forward broke his shin in his first
game

00:02:43.100 --> 00:02:50.700
Now I could not even tell you half of our
players names

00:02:51.000 --> 00:02:57.140
And one thought bulges like a disc inside
Steve Nash

00:02:58.120 --> 00:03:05.100
No more back-to-backs,
The past is in the past!

00:03:05.360 --> 00:03:09.380
LET IT TANK, LET IT TANK!

00:03:09.380 --> 00:03:16.120
I'll never get that sixth
Let it tank, let it tank

00:03:16.120 --> 00:03:20.140
Dwight Howard's a soft-ass B*tch!

00:03:20.140 --> 00:03:28.280
Here I stand
King of L.A.

00:03:28.460 --> 00:03:33.740
Laker Nation!

00:03:33.740 --> 00:03:36.520
Getting old never bothered me anyway...

00:03:48.920 --> 00:03:53.600
BLEACHER  REPORT MEDIA LAB 2015

